# .gitattributes
# ================
# The repo has a mix of LF and CRLF line endings across files edited on
# different OSes, which shows up as spurious "modified" diffs (no actual
# content change, just line-ending churn) in `git status` / `git diff`.
# This normalizes everything to LF on checkin, LF on checkout, for every
# platform.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Keep binary model/report artifacts untouched -- git should never try to
# normalize line endings inside these.
*.joblib binary
*.png binary
*.pkl binary
